  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="10">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Iudex">Iudex</ref> 10</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Oft eac þa godan deman habbað yfele gingran 7 reafgende, mid ðæra scylde þa deman habbað hí besmitene; 7 gyf heo hym hyra reaflaces ne gestyrað, þonne forweorðaþ hí, ða deman, þurh hyra gyngrena synna.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Often also good judges keep evil and rapacious assistants, and their guilt contaminates the judges; and if they fail to remove their [the assistants’] robbery, then they [the judges] will perish because of the sins of their assistants.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Sepe etiam boni iudices habent malos uicarios et ministros refantes, quorum reatibus ipsi domini constringuntur, si non eos coherceant et a rapacitate cohibeant;</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
